<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7460" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cĕphălēnĭa</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-allānia</span></b> ),
			ae, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κεφαληνία</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κεφαλληνία</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the largest island in the Ionian Sea</i>, now <i>Cephalonia</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 7,
				10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 12, 19, § 54 sq.</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Liv. 37, 13, 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">38, 9, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">38, 28, 7</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Flor. 2, 9,
				4</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>a.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cĕphălēnes</span></b> ,
			um, m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κεφαλῆνες</span>, <i>the inhabitants of
				Cephalenia</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 37, 13, 12</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 15,
				305</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cĕphălēnītae</span></b> ,
				ārum, m., the same,
					<i><span class="en">Serv. ad Verg. E. 8,
		68</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
